flowchart LR
  A[Register patient] --> B[Create case]
  B --> C[Upload histopathology image]
  C --> D{Input eligible?}
  D -->|No| E[Reject or request review]
  D -->|Yes| F[Run HER2 prediction]
  F --> G[Compute confidence and uncertainty]
  F --> H[Generate Grad-CAM]
  G & H --> I[Doctor reviews evidence]
  I --> J[Add notes or history]
  J --> K[Generate LLM draft]
  K --> L{Clinician decision}
  L -->|Accept| M[Save and report]
  L -->|Reject| N[Discard or investigate]
